pandoc 

  to: html
  output-file: example.html
  standalone: true
  section-divs: true
  html-math-method: mathjax
  wrap: none
  default-image-extension: png
  toc: true
  

metadata

  document-css: false
  link-citations: true
  date-format: long
  lang: en
  title: GitHub Extension For Quarto
  subtitle: Quarto Extension
  author:
    - name: Mickaël CANOUIL, _Ph.D._
      orcid: 0000-0002-3396-4549
      url: https://mickael.canouil.fr
  extensions:
    github:
      repository-name: jlord/sheetsee.js
      base-url: https://github.com
  

(W) The "GitHub" extension has been superseded by the "Git Link" extension. Please update your extension following the instructions at: https://github.com/mcanouil/quarto-gitlink?tab=readme-ov-file#installation

